{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And it shall be.</b> Now he explained that the slaughter of the pesach depends on the land. And let not the pesach of Mount Sinai be difficult for you, for it was a supernal commandment, and they did not perform another pesach in the wilderness, for at Mount Sinai they were with a settlement and could find matzot, and when they were in a land through which no man had passed, they had only the manna alone:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:33:44.736562522Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}